      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看起来是个有礼貌又诚实的人。\n透过详细报导说不定能吸引更多\n支持<chrname>的粉丝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09348d618dcd08ba10363c27b0a7561eb785cda5995276ca4a316bbe0b932339",
